#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:5 7449bb23c8cd4b26a050d0e912d2d7ca
msgid "Arming Plane"
msgstr "解锁 Plane"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:7 661e5e0a245347f59551ae05e28d76a1
msgid ""
"Before you can fly your plane you need to arm it. Arming the aircraft "
"before flight has two purposes:"
msgstr "飞行前需要解锁飞机。起飞前解锁飞行器有两个目的："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:10 9219293bc6464cf9a24422b7d96c8688
msgid ""
"prevent the motor from turning when the pilot is not ready to fly (a "
"safety feature)"
msgstr "防止在飞手未准备好飞行时电机转动（安全功能）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:12 8f6170799e26445b85187f47764bf9c1
msgid "prevent takeoff before the autopilot is fully configured and ready to fly"
msgstr "防止在飞控未完全配置并准备好飞行前起飞"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:15 03a3445e25574c9da0e3c81c1273ad02
msgid ""
"The key thing that arming does is to enable the motor. You will not be "
"able to start the motor (ie. control the throttle) until the aircraft is "
"armed."
msgstr "解锁的关键作用是启用电机。在飞行器解锁之前，您将无法启动电机（即控制油门）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:19 b5155ef24c6d4d03bfceedd5d6653983
msgid ""
"**Note**: If you have :ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE<AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` set to 2 or 3 "
"(you are using one of the EKFs) then it is particularly important that "
"you have arming checks enabled for INS. Flying EKF without arming checks "
"may cause a crash."
msgstr ""
"**注意**：如果将 :ref:`AHRS_EKF_TYPE<AHRS_EKF_TYPE>` 设为 2 或 3（使用 EKF），则对 INS "
"启用解锁检查尤为重要。在没有解锁检查的情况下飞行 EKF 可能导致坠机。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:24 b73ce97df2ec4c63af65fb074f3d0d1b
msgid ""
"This feature in no way removes the need to respect the prop! When the "
"plane is powered, ALWAYS avoid placing hands in the vicinity of the "
"propeller, even when the throttle is disarmed. If all is not well with "
"the autopilot electronics or software there is always a slight "
"possibility that signal could unintentionally reach the motor. Even "
"though this is unlikely (and made even less likely by safety features "
"such as this) it only takes one time to chew up a finger or hand!"
msgstr "此功能绝不能消除对螺旋桨的敬畏！飞机通电时，请始终避免将手靠近螺旋桨附近，即使油门已上锁。如果飞控电子或软件出现问题，信号可能意外传递到电机。尽管这种情况极少发生（此类安全功能使其更加不可能），但只需一次就可能造成手指或手部受伤！"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:34 162efec4cc2946ce9d8aab275c004b6d
msgid "Configuring Arming"
msgstr "配置解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:36 d6cde0642a1947b8a8724bf13146167b
msgid "There are three parameters which control how arming works:"
msgstr "控制解锁方式的参数有三个："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:38 d0eec628f6ba4976b9e8c805f5c304dd
msgid ""
":ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE<ARMING_REQUIRE>`: this controls whether an arming "
"step is required. The default is 1, meaning that arming is required "
"before takeoff. If set to 0 then arming is not required (the plane starts"
" off armed)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE<ARMING_REQUIRE>`：控制是否需要解锁步骤。默认值为 1，表示起飞前需要解锁。若设为 "
"0，则不需要解锁（飞机起始即为已解锁状态）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:42 b1b614a9c2174e98ac18b32c94be542e
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
":ref:`ARMING_SKIPCHK<ARMING_SKIPCHK>`: this controls what checks the "
"autopilot does before arming is allowed. The default is 0, meaning all "
"checks are done. Most users should leave it at 0, as the arming checks "
"are important to ensure the autopilot is ready. See below."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ARMING_CHECK<ARMING_CHECK>`：控制飞控在允许解锁前执行的检查项目。默认值为 "
"1，表示执行所有检查。大多数用户应保持为 1，因为解锁检查对确保飞控已准备就绪非常重要。详见下文。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:46 ddd17ef4065f432887c9055dba23f219
msgid ""
":ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>`: This parameter allows you to "
"configure rudder based arming/disarming. The default is 1, meaning you "
"are able to arm with right rudder. If you set this to 2 you can also "
"disarm with left rudder. If you set this to 0 then you will only be able "
"to arm/disarm via a ground station or RC channel input using its "
"RCx_OPTION."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>`：此参数允许配置基于方向舵的解锁/上锁操作。默认值为 "
"1，表示可以使用右方向舵解锁。若设为 2，还可以使用左方向舵上锁。若设为 0，则只能通过地面站或使用 RCx_OPTION 的 RC "
"通道输入进行解锁/上锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:52 39aba51396d24d19b0ca6657f48149d9
msgid ""
"if :ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>` is set to 2, then held left rudder"
" can disarm the vehicle in ANY mode, if the autopilot judges that the "
"vehicle is not flying. This flying check CAN be incorrect under certain "
"extreme circumstances, and disarming of the vehicle while still in "
"flight, while rare, could occur."
msgstr ""
"若 :ref:`ARMING_RUDDER<ARMING_RUDDER>` 设为 "
"2，则在任何模式下，如果飞控判断飞行器未在飞行，持续左方向舵可以上锁飞行器。此飞行状态判断在某些极端情况下可能不准确，飞行中意外上锁虽然罕见但可能发生。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:55 b62ad36a8ec74beeb6749e9b2f9e5c5f
msgid "Arming Checks"
msgstr "解锁检查"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:57 5f230c1f0cdb4ecc8069e105507da272
msgid ""
"Before allowing arming the autopilot checks a set of conditions. All "
"conditions must pass for arming to be allowed. If any condition fails "
"then a message explaining what failed is set to the GCS. Any or all of "
"the Pre-Arming Checks can be disabled, but it is not recommended. See the"
" :ref:`common-prearm-safety-checks` topic for more information."
msgstr ""
"允许解锁前，飞控会检查一组条件。所有条件必须全部通过才能解锁。若任何条件不满足，将向 GCS "
"发送说明失败原因的消息。任何或所有预解锁检查均可禁用，但不建议这样做。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`common-prearm-safety-"
"checks` 主题。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:63 d9612710a9fe4f519d55147e4ae2d210
msgid "IMPORTANT: RC Transmitter Calibration"
msgstr "重要：RC 遥控器校准"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:65 43eac8db293d4fdf889101311851813d
msgid ""
"It is essential that your RC radio transmitter be calibrated correctly "
"before continuing. Please see the :ref:`Calibrate your RC input <common-"
"radio-control-calibration>` wiki page if you don't know how to calibrate "
"your radio."
msgstr ""
"继续之前，RC 无线电遥控器必须正确校准。如果不知道如何校准遥控器，请参阅 :ref:`校准 RC 输入 <common-radio-"
"control-calibration>` Wiki 页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:68 381a64e2cb524097a0c3ad42db178251
msgid ""
"When calibrating your RC input you should also be careful to set the "
"minimum value of the throttle (usually RC3_MIN) to the minimum value when"
" in normal flight control. Don't set it to the value used by your "
"transmitter when in throttle failsafe or you won't be able to arm using "
"the rudder as the autopilot will think you are at a non-zero throttle "
"level."
msgstr ""
"校准 RC 输入时，还应注意将油门最小值（通常为 "
"RC3_MIN）设置为正常飞行控制时的最小值。不要将其设置为遥控器在油门失控保护时使用的值，否则飞控会认为您的油门不在零位，导致无法用方向舵解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:75 b337e6c26a414d20b714fb4936daf5e6
msgid "How to Arm"
msgstr "如何解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:77 f3b8302e987c4d189de721493f88ca8a
msgid ""
"When you are ready to fly you can ask Plane to arm. This can be done in "
"three ways:"
msgstr "准备好飞行时，可以要求 Plane 解锁。有三种方式："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:80 4d1f7cd7d3f54abfa1baf6a96e2a8606
msgid ""
"**Rudder Arming**. Hold the rudder stick fully to the right and the "
"throttle stick fully down for 3 seconds."
msgstr "**方向舵解锁**。将方向舵摇杆完全向右拨并将油门摇杆完全向下保持 3 秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:83 18fcc0cef63d4fe4a6d6364c31b29bc7
msgid ""
"when rudder arming in QuadPlanes with an autotakeoff, the motors will "
"spin at :ref:`Q_M_SPIN_ARM<Q_M_SPIN_ARM>` and not takeoff until the "
"rudder stick is returned to neutral. Similarly, for normal plane MODE "
"TAKEOFF, or NAV_TAKEOFFs, the arming will not actually occur until the "
"rudder stick is returned to neutral to prevent the takeoff starting with "
"full right rudder."
msgstr ""
"在 QuadPlane 中进行方向舵解锁并启用自动起飞时，电机将以 :ref:`Q_M_SPIN_ARM<Q_M_SPIN_ARM>` "
"转速旋转，直到方向舵摇杆回到中立位置才会起飞。同样，对于普通固定翼 MODE TAKEOFF 或 "
"NAV_TAKEOFF，解锁实际上不会发生，直到方向舵摇杆回到中立位置，以防止在满右方向舵时开始起飞。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:85 bacc2868055848bc8fae9b45ac1cb8de
msgid ""
"If setup, you can use one of the **RC_xOPTION switches** that includes "
"that function. See switch option \"153\", \"154, or \"160\"."
msgstr "如已设置，可使用包含该功能的 **RC_xOPTION 开关**。请参阅开关选项「153」、「154」或「160」。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:86 8ab445abe6cf4f6ab9750905a9911ad0
msgid "**GCS Arming**. Press the arming button on your ground station"
msgstr "**GCS 解锁**。在地面站按下解锁按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:91 cd6eb8bf416f42dc996fa2b463a07557
msgid ""
"Location of the Arm/Disarm button in Mission Planner (button circled in "
"red near the bottom of the image)."
msgstr "Mission Planner 中解锁/上锁按钮的位置（图像底部附近红圈标注的按钮）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:93 28dbb668c43849d58492b4f5f3e988a9
msgid ""
"Plane does not allow arming in RTL, QRTL, or QLAND modes. Arming in other"
" throttle controlled modes, like LOITER,CRUISE,etc. is possible, but only"
" if actually flying (ie after an accidental inflight disarm, watchdog "
"reset, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"Plane 不允许在 RTL、QRTL 或 QLAND 模式下解锁。在 LOITER、CRUISE "
"等其他油门控制模式下解锁是可能的，但仅在实际飞行时（即意外飞行中上锁、看门狗复位等之后）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:96 82f96280ebf74cd8918f00405c4eb42f
msgid "How to Disarm"
msgstr "如何上锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:98 8ec35795f0d6434c8489b9f2906fec1f
msgid ""
"If setup, you can use one of the ``RC_xOPTION`` switches that includes "
"that function. See switch option \"81\", \"153, or \"154\"."
msgstr "如已设置，可使用包含该功能的 ``RC_xOPTION`` 开关。请参阅开关选项「81」、「153」或「154」。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:100 2b705daa92f5499a847646f134477cf3
msgid ""
"This is **UNCONDITIONAL**. If done while in flight, all motors disarm and"
" you must have throttle at idle before re-arming can occur!"
msgstr "这是 **无条件的**。若在飞行中执行，所有电机将上锁，必须将油门置于怠速后才能重新解锁！"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:102 bbf61db983534386b57a578e339beb0f
msgid ""
"It is also possible to disarm using the transmitter. This is done holding"
" throttle at minimum and rudder to the left for 2 seconds. In ArduPlane "
"this condition could be accidentally triggered by pilots while flying so "
"there are additional requirements prior to disarm:"
msgstr ""
"也可以使用遥控器上锁。方法是将油门保持在最低位置并将方向舵拨向左侧保持 2 秒。在 ArduPlane "
"中，此操作在飞行中可能被飞手意外触发，因此上锁前还有额外要求："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:107 4c9f76f47e8448ee969d3343068ee88a
msgid ""
"You need to allow rudder disarming by changing **ARMING_RUDDER** "
"parameter to 2 (ArmOrDisarm) or use the ARM/DISARM switch function "
"provided by setting an RC channel's RCx_OPTION to 153."
msgstr ""
"需要将 **ARMING_RUDDER** 参数更改为 2（ArmOrDisarm）以允许方向舵上锁，或使用将 RC 通道的 RCx_OPTION"
" 设为 153 提供的 ARM/DISARM 开关功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:110 3eea73934782437b81cc8f5db28af6fd
msgid ""
"The autopilot needs to make sure that you are not actually flying. There "
"is an algorithm for this that uses the **airspeed sensor** readings. So "
"you need this source available and giving values lower enough (in a windy"
" day you might not be able to disarm even landed if the plane thinks you "
"are still flying)"
msgstr ""
"飞控需要确认您实际上没有在飞行。有一套利用 **空速传感器** "
"读数的算法来判断。因此您需要此数据源可用且值足够低（在大风天，即使已降落，如果飞机认为您仍在飞行，也可能无法上锁）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:116 78996615eb8349ff8323d2bdac92cee6
msgid ""
"You can also disarm without using the transmitter with one of the "
"following methods:"
msgstr "也可以不通过遥控器进行上锁，方法如下："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:119 5be960517d364831b29dee6b9c57a5e6
msgid "use a ground station to issue a disarm command"
msgstr "使用地面站发送上锁命令"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:120 e667d6dc5ba243e7bcab07ed56ea6b10
msgid ""
"use the safety switch on your aircraft (if using a :ref:`common-safety-"
"switch-pixhawk`)"
msgstr "使用飞机上的安全开关（如使用 :ref:`common-safety-switch-pixhawk`）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:121 2b69655062e3428e9e94674fddd696ca
msgid ""
"after an auto-landing (either via mission or QLAND in QuadPlane) the "
"plane will automatically disarm after 20 seconds if still on the ground "
"(controlled by :ref:`LAND_DISARMDELAY<LAND_DISARMDELAY>` parameter)"
msgstr ""
"自动降落后（通过任务或 QuadPlane 中的 QLAND），飞机在着陆后 20 秒将自动上锁（由 "
":ref:`LAND_DISARMDELAY<LAND_DISARMDELAY>` 参数控制）"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:126 4a96dc87e98a48b698ed9a4679aa4403
msgid "Visual and Audible signals"
msgstr "视觉和听觉信号"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:128 cb8341ef6a234d8e8270347fd89b6a20
msgid ""
"ArduPlane will provide visual and audio clues to the arming state if your"
" autopilot has notification LEDs and a buzzer. The clues are:"
msgstr "若飞控具有通知 LED 和蜂鸣器，ArduPlane 将通过视觉和音频提示指示解锁状态。提示如下："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:131 f6154d24eef44eba8e2995ee253171aa
msgid ""
"if the autopilot is disarmed, but is ready to arm then the large 3-colour"
" LED will be flashing green"
msgstr "若飞控已上锁但准备好解锁，大型三色 LED 将闪烁绿色"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:133 1d9ff5339bb34c7bbac464fd2fce17d4
msgid ""
"if the autopilot is armed and ready to fly the large 3-colour LED is "
"solid green"
msgstr "若飞控已解锁且准备好飞行，大型三色 LED 将常亮绿色"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:135 5eb657db524240968f42ca8186659ecf
msgid ""
"when the autopilot is ready to arm it will play a \"ready to arm\" sound "
"on the buzzer"
msgstr "当飞控准备好解锁时，蜂鸣器会播放「准备解锁」的声音"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:137 7d7c2301a31e486c9cb0226efa39e359
msgid ""
"when the autopilot is armed or disarmed it will play the corresponding "
"sound"
msgstr "当飞控解锁或上锁时，将播放相应的音效"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:140 f2e0aa9b9fa6466fb7f1eef5decc13bf
msgid ""
"See the :ref:`sounds page <common-sounds-pixhawkpx4>` to listen to what "
"the buzzer sounds like for each state."
msgstr "请参阅 :ref:`音效页面 <common-sounds-pixhawkpx4>` 聆听每种状态对应的蜂鸣器音效。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:143 23506b9a12d44257b0cf9c60a21645b7
msgid ""
"Unless the :ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` bit 1 is set, text "
"messages will be sent to the GCS to indicate when arming or disarming has"
" occurred."
msgstr "除非设置了 :ref:`ARMING_OPTIONS<ARMING_OPTIONS>` 的第 1 位，否则解锁或上锁时将向 GCS 发送文字消息。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:146 62f945514ae544769940a17243734dd3
msgid "Throttle output when disarmed"
msgstr "上锁时的油门输出"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:148 9bb12d022ce74317b449aac29e3195ba
msgid ""
"When the plane is disarmed the throttle channel will not respond to pilot"
" input. There are two possible behaviors you can configure:"
msgstr "飞机上锁时，油门通道不响应飞手输入。可配置两种行为："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:151 40adc10602be47c4ae3202dc7f4858e7
msgid ""
":ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE<ARMING_REQUIRE>` = 1. When disarmed the minimum "
"value for the throttle channel (normally RC3_MIN) will be sent to the "
"throttle channel"
msgstr ""
":ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE<ARMING_REQUIRE>` = 1。上锁时，油门通道（通常为 "
"RC3_MIN）的最小值将发送到油门通道"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:153 930598157f4b4ee1b4599e85d798129a
msgid ""
":ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE<ARMING_REQUIRE>` = 2. When disarmed no pulses are "
"sent to the throttle channel. Note that some ESCs will beep to complain "
"that they are powered on without a control signal or even refuse to "
"initialize and operate."
msgstr ""
":ref:`ARMING_REQUIRE<ARMING_REQUIRE>` = 2。上锁时不向油门通道发送脉冲。注意，某些 ESC "
"会发出蜂鸣声抱怨通电后没有控制信号，甚至拒绝初始化和运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:158 abf8a37183804eb69141afecd66c8968
msgid "Diagnosing failure to arm"
msgstr "诊断无法解锁的故障"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:160 b3e2aff7839540849784b036f8a1309e
msgid ""
"It can be frustrating if your plane refuses to arm. To diagnose arming "
"issues follow this guide"
msgstr "如果飞机拒绝解锁，可能令人沮丧。请按以下指南诊断解锁问题"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:164 e3a0c59187cb4415a4ef6fb68b200380
msgid "In Landing Sequence Pre-Arm Failure"
msgstr "在降落序列中预解锁失败"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:166 21d8400731a34ed6847fbe2cbbca0a50
msgid ""
"If the last mission item was a landing sequence or land command, then "
"arming is prevented and a \"Prearm: In Landing Sequence\" message is "
"presented. This can occur after an autoland, or if the autopilot is "
"booted before RC is established and the failsafe mode uses a landing "
"sequence (ie :ref:`common-do-land-start` and "
":ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` is set, QLAND, etc.)."
msgstr ""
"如果最后一个任务项是降落序列或降落命令，则解锁将被阻止，并显示「Prearm: In Landing "
"Sequence」消息。这可能发生在自动降落后，或在 RC 未建立时飞控启动而失控保护模式使用降落序列（即 :ref:`common-do-"
"land-start` 且 :ref:`RTL_AUTOLAND<RTL_AUTOLAND>` 已设置、QLAND 等）时。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:168 fe5f771482bb48c688d5f6329125ae23
msgid ""
"This may be cleared by restarting the mission using the GCS or :ref"
":`common-auxiliary-functions` switch, or rebooting with RC active."
msgstr ""
"可通过使用 GCS 或 :ref:`common-auxiliary-functions` 开关重启任务，或在 RC "
"激活的情况下重新启动来清除此状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:171 5cd3f30a861f4f67acadefdb2ddd3a26
msgid "Check that it is ready to arm"
msgstr "检查是否准备好解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:173 7e96444067e845bab61fd1bc72286443
msgid ""
"If your board has a \"ready to arm\" LED (the large LED in the middle of "
"the board on a Pixhawk, for example) then that LED should be flashing "
"green when the board is ready to arm. If it is flashing yellow then that "
"indicates that one of the arming checks is not passing."
msgstr ""
"如果主板有「准备解锁」LED（例如 Pixhawk 主板中间的大 LED），则主板准备好解锁时该 LED "
"应闪烁绿色。如果闪烁黄色，则表示某项解锁检查未通过。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:179 db5688898bc4451aacb84aded42849e5
msgid "Try arming"
msgstr "尝试解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:181 9217eddbe4b747f0adf2b5b8f1ce2463
msgid ""
"Try sending an arm command with your GCS. If arming is refused then a "
"message will be sent from the autopilot to the GCS indicating why it is "
"refusing to arm."
msgstr "尝试通过 GCS 发送解锁命令。若解锁被拒绝，飞控将向 GCS 发送消息说明拒绝原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:186 ca7772c8ffbc468db86ae18da176cded
msgid "Rudder arming"
msgstr "方向舵解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:188 3b910e05e0ab490e9ce14de3e7b33d92
msgid ""
"If you are using right-rudder + zero-throttle to arm and you don't get a "
"message on your GCS giving a arming failure reason then it may be that "
"your RC calibration is a bit off and the autopilot is not quite seeing "
"zero throttle or isn't quite seeing full right rudder."
msgstr "如果使用右方向舵加零油门解锁时 GCS 没有显示解锁失败原因，可能是 RC 校准偏差导致飞控无法准确识别零油门或满右方向舵。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:194 9a3df40fadbd41dfb9ad96cc000cfc83
msgid "Reasons for refusing to arm"
msgstr "拒绝解锁的原因"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:196 0993dc3a069849cb88f98386faaea11d
msgid ""
"When the autopilot refuses to arm it sends a STATUSTEXT MAVLink message "
"to the GCS explaining why it is refusing. Some possible reasons why the "
"autopilot can refuse to arm are (See the :ref:`common-prearm-safety-"
"checks` topic for more information):"
msgstr ""
"当飞控拒绝解锁时，会向 GCS 发送 STATUSTEXT MAVLink 消息说明原因。以下是飞控可能拒绝解锁的一些原因（更多信息请参阅 "
":ref:`common-prearm-safety-checks` 主题）："

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:200 cec4cb7e210144ba8537bf7880e8acf3
msgid ""
"**barometer not healthy**. This is very rare. If it happens repeatedly "
"then you may have a barometer hardware fault."
msgstr "**气压计不正常**。这种情况非常罕见。如果反复出现，则可能存在气压计硬件故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:202 e267e681beea471ea54895ae96330f99
msgid ""
"**airspeed not healthy**. If you have a airspeed sensor fitted and the "
"autopilot is not getting an airspeed reading it will refuse to arm."
msgstr "**空速不正常**。如果安装了空速传感器但飞控未获取到空速读数，将拒绝解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:205 cb287758d0304dcc9f74781104b0974d
msgid ""
"**logging not available**. If your microSD card has failed or is corrupt "
"then logging won't be available and you cannot arm."
msgstr "**日志记录不可用**。如果 microSD 卡损坏或失效，日志记录将不可用，无法解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:207 01a3f6cb201a4eeda9e29888dde1f8f0
msgid ""
"**gyros not healthy**. If the gyros have failed the autopilot will refuse"
" to arm. This is rare, and if it happens repeatedly then you may have a "
"hardware failure."
msgstr "**陀螺仪不正常**。如果陀螺仪发生故障，飞控将拒绝解锁。这种情况罕见，反复出现可能存在硬件故障。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:210 b70da78892a34e73a54b23c7743c671d
msgid ""
"**gyros not calibrated**. This happens when the automatic gyro "
"calibration at startup didn't converge. Try rebooting the autopilot with "
"the plane held still."
msgstr "**陀螺仪未校准**。这发生在启动时自动陀螺仪校准未收敛时。请尝试保持飞机静止后重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:213 1257a941b62742ad884584e8fd8db476
msgid ""
"**accels not healthy**. If the accelerometers have failed the autopilot "
"will refuse to arm. Try recalibrating your accelerometers."
msgstr "**加速度计不正常**。如果加速度计发生故障，飞控将拒绝解锁。请尝试重新校准加速度计。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:215 e0ce592eb7d54efd99d898f9c6f18f36
msgid ""
"**GPS accuracy errors**. There are 4 types of GPS arming errors that can "
"be reported. They are \"GPS vert vel error\", \"GPS speed error\", \"GPS "
"horiz error\", \"GPS numsats\". Try moving your plane for better GPS "
"reception or switching off any RF sources (such as a FPV transmitter) "
"that may be interfering with your GPS."
msgstr ""
"**GPS 精度错误**。有 4 种 GPS 解锁错误：「GPS vert vel error」、「GPS speed error」、「GPS "
"horiz error」、「GPS numsats」。请尝试移动飞机以获得更好的 GPS 接收，或关闭可能干扰 GPS 的 RF "
"源（如图传发射机）。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:220 a9bfb41819ed47af82f3db7db2756e02
msgid ""
"**Mag yaw error**. This happens when your compass is badly out of "
"alignment. Check your compass orientation and re-do your compass "
"calibration or move your plane further away from any magnetic materials."
msgstr "**罗盘偏航误差**。这发生在罗盘严重偏差时。请检查罗盘方向并重新校准罗盘，或将飞机移离任何磁性材料。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:224 8094b7cd70d641c0b751952a4f0b19ee
msgid ""
"**EKF warmup**. This happens when the EKF is still warming up. Wait "
"another 10 seconds and try again."
msgstr "**EKF 预热**。这发生在 EKF 仍在预热时。请等待 10 秒后再试。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:226 85f69231a8954813b7369ea74866b028
msgid ""
"**AHRS not healthy**. This means the EKF is not healthy. Often this is "
"due to large variations in GPS position and/or velocity reports, even if "
"a solid 3D lock is reported by the GPS and HDOP is low. Be sure your GPS "
"has a clear \"view\" of the sky with no obstructions. If the error "
"persists then try rebooting your board."
msgstr ""
"**AHRS 不正常**。这意味着 EKF 不正常。通常是由于 GPS 位置和/或速度报告存在较大变化，即使 GPS 报告了稳定的 3D 定锁且 "
"HDOP 较低。请确保 GPS 对天空有清晰的「视野」，无遮挡。如果错误持续，请尝试重启主板。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:227 9e6d4e453d73449d8eeb143194ec2174
msgid ""
"**3D accel cal needed**. This happens when you have not done a 3D "
"accelerometer calibration."
msgstr "**需要 3D 加速度计校准**。这发生在尚未进行 3D 加速度计校准时。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:229 1284eb6dc7b349bc9c74cc807846eef6
msgid ""
"**Inconsistent accelerometers**. This happens when you have multiple IMUs"
" (such as the Pixhawk which has two) and they are not consistent. This "
"can be caused by temperature changes. If the error doesn't clear itself "
"after a minute you will need to redo your accelerometer calibration."
msgstr ""
"**加速度计不一致**。这发生在具有多个 IMU（如 Pixhawk "
"有两个）时，它们不一致。可能由温度变化引起。如果错误在一分钟后未自行消除，需要重新校准加速度计。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:234 51657ce9c7cb4aa9b94b0d56a3217bf3
msgid ""
"**Inconsistent gyros**. This happens when you have multiple gyros and "
"they are not reporting consistent values. If the error does not clear "
"itself after 30 seconds then you will need to reboot."
msgstr "**陀螺仪不一致**。这发生在具有多个陀螺仪且它们报告的值不一致时。如果错误在 30 秒后未自行消除，需要重新启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:237 effe85779cb74aac997b86ff66304976
msgid ""
"**Limit errors**. The arming checks some of your parameter settings to "
"make sure they are in a reasonable range. The checks are \"ROLL_LIMIT_DEG"
" too small\", \"PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG too small\", \"PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG too "
"large\", \"invalid THR_FS_VALUE\"."
msgstr ""
"**限制错误**。解锁检查会检查某些参数设置是否在合理范围内。检查项目为「ROLL_LIMIT_DEG too "
"small」、「PTCH_LIM_MAX_DEG too small」、「PTCH_LIM_MIN_DEG too large」、「invalid"
" THR_FS_VALUE」。"

#: ../../source/docs/arming-your-plane.rst:241 82f2771e92354763a7b708946e4d9a66
msgid ""
"**GPS n has not been fully configured**. This happens with a uBlox GPS "
"where the GPS driver is unable to fully configure the GPS for the "
"settings that are being requested. This can be caused by a bad wire "
"between the autopilot and GPS, or by a bad response from the GPS. If the "
"message is about \"GPS 0\" then it is the first GPS. If it is \"GPS 1\" "
"then it is the 2nd GPS. If you get a failure for the 2nd GPS and don't "
"have two GPS modules installed then set GPS_TYPE2 to zero to disable the "
"2nd GPS"
msgstr ""
"**GPS n 未完全配置**。这发生在 uBlox GPS 驱动程序无法按所请求的设置完全配置 GPS 时。可能由飞控与 GPS "
"之间的线缆不良或 GPS 响应不良引起。如果消息是「GPS 0」，则为第一个 GPS；「GPS 1」则为第二个 GPS。如果第二个 GPS "
"失败且未安装两个 GPS 模块，请将 GPS_TYPE2 设为零以禁用第二个 GPS"

